{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07513","headline":"湘中忆归 · 刘长卿","name":"湘中忆归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日空理棹，经年犹别家。\n顷来行已远，弥觉天无涯。\n白云意自深，沧海梦难隔。\n迢递万里帆，飘颻一行客。\n独怜西江外，远寄风波里。\n平湖流楚天，孤鴈渡湘水。\n湘流澹澹空愁予，猨啼啾啾满南楚。\n扁舟泊处闻此声，江客相看泪如雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}